Project: Avero – Smart Local Tourism Business Portal.
The Next.js app lives in /avero-web (App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui with Radix).
All paths below are relative to /avero-web.

Colors (Tailwind tokens):
- terracotta #E07856 (dominant: primary buttons, accents, active states)
- teal-navy #1B4B4A (minor accent only)
- cream #FAF6F1 (page background)
- amber #F2A93B (highlights, badges, ratings)

Typography: Poppins for UI; Playfair Display (serif) for large headlines.
Texture: faded light orange-and-white gradient behind hero and headline areas.

Rules:
- Icons: lucide-react or inline SVG only. NEVER icon fonts or Material Icons ligatures.
- All colors come from tailwind/theme tokens, never hardcode hex in components.
- Shared components live in src/components/ui/, providers in src/providers/.
- Mock data lives in src/data/ and is the single source of truth for listings.
- Use one shared interest taxonomy (src/data/interests.ts) everywhere.
- Responsive: mobile-first, must look good at 375px and 1440px.